        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Tilapia",
        "text_sha256": "b6c4331936fefc676cddae9fe93f8406067e47cd64a5eb7c126d29cc7727db4b",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "A few fish, however, are best to avoid if you're trying to get pregnant since they have high levels of mercury. These include (but are not limited to):",
        "text_sha256": "2af12a79cf46c0811ccce05ffc19fc5da6a990ada2a474060cd7f37383e46eba",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Bigeye tuna",
        "text_sha256": "f17ae601fee4574dc2cd07668bd760a621bc00d9e0f219de96f7c85fd9aa98e1",
